{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句「」內文字的字音，依序與哪一選項文字的字音完全相同？\n星期日中午，健民到餐廳點了清炒「莧」菜、糖醋「鯛」魚片這兩樣他最喜歡\n的菜。健民正吃得開心，沒想到一不留神，魚肉掉在褲子上，留下一片污「漬」。\n儘管如此，他還是覺得美味的佳餚令人「吮」指回味。", "options": {"A": "件／稠／眥／楯", "B": "件／凋／嘖／允", "C": "現／稠／嘖／允", "D": "現／凋／眥／楯"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 72.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 47.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 87.0, 78.0, 66.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句中，有關「齒」、「恥」二字的使用，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "謙虛的人能不齒下問，驕傲的人總自以為是", "B": "高舉公理正義的大旗做傷天害理的事，最令人不恥", "C": "他公然說謊卻絲毫不覺歉疚，難怪會被批評為無齒", "D": "有些人只寫過幾篇小文章就自號才子，真是讓人齒冷"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 73.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 94.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 50.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 89.0, 81.0, 66.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句「」內成語的運用，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "李大華的爸爸和媽媽身材都很高大，稱得上是「椿萱並茂」", "B": "他把子女教養得很好，對子女而言，真可說是「無忝所生」了", "C": "小李經常花大錢買漂亮的衣服送給父母，不愧是「彩衣娛親」的孝子", "D": "陳先生提早退休，全心照顧年邁的母親，「烏鳥私情」的孝行，令人感動"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 80.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 93.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 64.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 64.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 89.0, 84.0, 77.0, 56.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下列詩句，選出最符合作者人生態度的選項：\n賦命有厚薄，委心任窮通。通當為大鵬，舉翅摩蒼穹。窮則為鷦鷯，一枝足自\n容。苟知此道者，身窮心不窮。（白居易〈我身〉）", "options": {"A": "人生多艱，宜苦中作樂，自求安慰", "B": "人生在世，難免遭遇挫折，當積極解決困境", "C": "人生際遇不同，宜順應自然，使心不困滯於外境", "D": "生命苦短，享樂宜先，不求為大鵬，唯願成鷦鷯"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 90.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 95.0, 90.0, 68.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列是小說中的一段文字，請依文意選出排列順序最恰當的選項：\n餐廳建築在濱海的山崖上，從落地玻璃窗望出去，\n(甲)海獸呼吸了一陣， (乙)便是粼光閃爍的海洋，\n(丙)光滑的背脊沾滿綠油油的燐光，背上一排呼吸孔開闔著噴出灰霧，\n(丁)餐廳裡並沒有多少人留意海獸出沒， (戊)又緩緩沉入海底，\n(己)這時正有一頭巨大的海獸緩緩從海中浮現，\n只有端菜來的侍者不經意提了一句。 （張系國〈傾城之戀〉）", "options": {"A": "乙丁甲戊丙己", "B": "乙己丙甲戊丁", "C": "己丙甲乙丁戊", "D": "己丁甲丙戊乙\n- 1 -\n96年學測 第 2 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 99.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 78.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 78.0, "discrimination": 21.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 96.0, 91.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "古代漢語有一種用來表示「認為某（人、事、物）是……的」的用法，例如《戰\n國策．齊策》：「吾妻之美我者，私我也」，句中的「美我」即是「認為我是美\n的」之意。下列文句「」內文字屬於此一用法的選項是：", "options": {"A": "《論語•里仁》：唯仁者能「好人」，能惡人", "B": "魏徵〈諫太宗十思疏〉：將有作，則思知止以「安人」", "C": "《孟子•盡心》：孔子登東山而「小魯」，登泰山而小天下", "D": "司馬光〈訓儉示康〉：小人寡欲，則能謹身節用，遠罪「豐家」"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 89.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 17.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 83.0, 71.0, 50.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列《孟子》文句，說明「學習成效受客觀環境所限制」的選項是：", "options": {"A": "離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方圓", "B": "人之所不學而能者，其良能也；所不慮而知者，其良知也", "C": "一齊人傅之，眾楚人咻之，雖日撻而求其齊也，不可得矣", "D": "人之有德慧術知者，恆存乎疢疾。獨孤臣孽子，其操心也危，其慮患也深，\n故達"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 91.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 77.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 77.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 97.0, 94.0, 67.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "文天祥〈正氣歌〉：「鼎鑊甘如飴，求之不可得」，句中的「鼎鑊」一詞，是由\n可各自獨立的「鼎」與「鑊」所構成，且「鼎」與「鑊」意義平行對等，不互\n相修飾。下列文句「」內的詞，與「鼎鑊」構成方式相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "《論語•為政》：五十而知「天命」", "B": "《論語•衛靈公》：「俎豆」之事，則嘗聞之矣", "C": "蘇軾〈赤壁賦〉：寄蜉蝣於天地，渺「滄海」之一粟", "D": "顧炎武〈廉恥〉：教其鮮卑語及彈「琵琶」，稍欲通解"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 19.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 52.0, 39.0, 28.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下文，選出敘述正確的選項：\n昔有雄雌二鴿，共同一巢。秋果熟時，取果滿巢。於其後時，果乾減少，\n唯半巢在。雄瞋雌言：「取果勤苦，汝獨食之，唯有半在！」雌鴿答言：「我不\n獨食，果自減少！」雄鴿不信，瞋恚而言：「非汝獨食，何由減少？」即便以\n嘴啄雌鴿，殺。未經幾日，天降大雨，果得濕潤，還復如故。雄鴿見已，方生\n悔恨：「彼實不食，我妄殺他！」(《百喻經•一鴿喻》)", "options": {"A": "雄鴿多疑固執，闖禍而不知悔悟", "B": "雄鴿未察真相，以至於誤殺雌鴿", "C": "雌鴿吃了果子，卻寧死不肯承認", "D": "雌鴿沒吃果子，果子是被偷走的"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 100.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 97.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 92.0, "discrimination": 8.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 100.0, 99.0, 98.0, 87.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下文，選出最符合全文主旨的選項：\n周秦間諸子之文，雖純駁不同，皆有箇自家在內。後世為文者，於彼於此，左\n顧右盼，以求當眾人之意，宜亦諸子所深恥歟！（劉熙載《藝概•文概》）", "options": {"A": "周秦諸子主張各異，互不相服", "B": "為文宜廣納眾說，以求左右逢源", "C": "文章當求表現自我面目，不可一味迎合世俗", "D": "後世為文者多慎選諸子的論述，印證自己的見解\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 96年學測\n共 7 頁 國文考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 78.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 86.0, 71.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "先秦諸子的思想與文章各有其特色，請推斷下列敘述中的甲、乙、丙、丁各指\n何人？\n甲、強調民貴君輕，其文表現出氣勢浩然的風格。\n乙、主張以嚴刑峻法治國，筆鋒峻峭犀利，論說透徹精闢。\n丙、強調教育和禮法的作用，善於運用排偶句法議論，邏輯周密。\n丁、追求逍遙的境界，善於寓哲理於寓言之中，想像玄妙，說理高超。\n甲 乙 丙 丁", "options": {"A": "莊子 孟子 韓非子 荀子", "B": "孟子 韓非子 荀子 莊子", "C": "莊子 孟子 荀子 韓非子", "D": "孟子 韓非子 莊子 荀子"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 90.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 99.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 98.0, 93.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上文三個□若均使用「擬人化」的動詞，且須兼顧前後文的呼應連貫，則□內\n最適合填入的選項是：", "options": {"A": "吞／欺／扔", "B": "舔／溜／打", "C": "融／游／挽", "D": "嚐／飄／捻"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 74.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 89.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 54.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 74.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 85.0, 78.0, 69.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「觀看那截枝葉，心思不免忙起來；頓覺枝非枝，葉非葉，必定有什麼深不可\n測的天諭包藏其間」，這一段文字所描述的經驗，實為文學形成過程中的一種\n心靈活動。下列敘述，與此活動最相近的選項是：", "options": {"A": "睹物興思，感物興情", "B": "虛靜其神，清和其心", "C": "想像鮮活，翻空出奇", "D": "摹寫景物，如在目前\n- 3 -\n96年學測 第 4 頁\n國文考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 69.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 82.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 54.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 77.0, 71.0, 67.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列關於山濤及其妻的敘述，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "山濤之妻有識人之明", "B": "山濤之妻善妒而好猜忌", "C": "山濤自認才能不輸嵇、阮", "D": "山濤之才極受嵇、阮肯定"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-15", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 55.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 67.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 43.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [70.0, 61.0, 56.0, 50.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "文中畫底線的「契」、「覺」、「以」、「勝」四個詞，各與下列選項「」內相同的\n詞比較，意義相同的選項是：", "options": {"A": "戰國策〈馮諼客孟嘗君〉：馮諼曰：願之。於是約車治裝，載券「契」而行", "B": "柳宗元〈始得西山宴遊記〉：意有所極，夢亦同趣，「覺」而起，起而歸", "C": "連橫〈臺灣通史序〉：茍欲「以」二三陳編而知臺灣大勢", "D": "蘇軾〈留侯論〉：其平居無罪夷滅者，不可「勝」數\n貳 、 多 選 題 （ 佔 24分 ）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "14-15", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 82.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 82.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 60.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 88.0, 79.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列文句「」內的比喻詞語，運用恰當的選項是：", "options": {"A": "眾溪是海洋的「手指」，索水於大山", "B": "他們像一群「螃蟹」，在地方上橫行", "C": "憂愁似「鹽巴」，少許可以提味，吃多倒盡胃口", "D": "煙囪就像是建築物的「眼睛」，能為房子帶來光明", "E": "書正如同「藥」，善讀可以醫愚，不善讀恐受其害"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABCE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 77.0, "B": 79.0, "C": 91.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 89.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 86.0, "B": 88.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 96.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 64.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 80.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 48.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 73.0, 68.0, 61.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "古典詩詞常有「時」、「空」對舉的文句，藉時、空的廣遠寄寓內心的慨歎。下\n列詩詞，使用此一表現方式的選項是：", "options": {"A": "玉界瓊田三萬頃，著我扁舟一葉", "B": "九天閶闔開宮殿，萬國衣冠拜冕旒", "C": "萬里悲秋常作客，百年多病獨登臺", "D": "三十功名塵與土，八千里路雲和月", "E": "世態十年看爛熟，家山萬里夢依稀\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 96年學測\n共 7 頁 國文考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "CDE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 33.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 87.0, "D": 76.0, "E": 91.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 28.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 87.0, "E": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 34.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 64.0, "E": 83.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 66.0, 59.0, 52.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "孔子認為，良好的道德修養具有普世價值，不受族群、地域的局限。下列《論\n語》文句，強調此一道理的選項是：", "options": {"A": "天下有道則見，無道則隱", "B": "言忠信，行篤敬，雖蠻貊之邦行矣", "C": "十室之邑，必有忠信如丘者焉，不如丘之好學也", "D": "君子敬而無失，與人恭而有禮，四海之內皆兄弟也", "E": "孔子於鄉黨，恂恂如也，似不能言者；其在宗廟朝廷，便便言，唯謹爾"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 90.0, "E": 17.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 100.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 94.0, "E": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 35.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 84.0, "E": 27.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 79.0, 71.0, 58.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列李白詩句畫線處，詮釋恰當的選項是：", "options": {"A": "「見說蠶叢路，崎嶇不易行。山從人面起，雲傍馬頭生」，形容山勢陡峻，\n行路窘迫", "B": "「浮雲遊子意，落日故人情。揮手自茲去，蕭蕭班馬鳴」，意謂友情如浮\n雲、落日，難得易逝", "C": "「抽刀斷水水更流，舉杯銷愁愁更愁。人生在世不稱意，明朝散髮弄扁舟」，\n強調滿腔憂鬱，揮之不去", "D": "「越王勾踐破吳歸，義士還鄉盡錦衣。宮女如花滿春殿，只今惟有鷓鴣飛」，\n表達盛衰無常，繁華成空", "E": "「雲想衣裳花想容，春風拂檻露華濃。若非群玉山頭見，會向瑤臺月下逢」，\n盛讚殿宇富麗，宛如天庭"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 55.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 69.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 99.0, "E": 12.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 90.0, "D": 80.0, "E": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 37.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 67.0, 61.0, 52.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列敘述，說明作家的作品風格與作家氣質相關的選項是：", "options": {"A": "陶淵明閑靜少言，崇尚自然，其詩樸質無華，真淳恬淡", "B": "韓愈耿介堅毅，敢於直諫，其散文雄渾剛健，氣勢磅薄", "C": "劉基博通經史，為明朝開國功臣，其散文筆致駿邁，意旨閎深", "D": "蘇軾器度恢弘，樂觀曠達，其散文汪洋恣肆，豪放詞尤獨具一格", "E": "王安石為北宋神宗時宰相，推行新法，其散文風格峭拔，結構謹嚴"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ABD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 93.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 85.0, "E": 75.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 98.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 94.0, "E": 76.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 85.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 54.0, "D": 73.0, "E": 68.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 19.0, "p_high": 22.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 5.0, "p_quintiles": [25.0, 18.0, 17.0, 18.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "國文課堂上討論「宋代貶謫文學」，範圍為范仲淹〈岳陽樓記〉、歐陽脩〈醉翁\n亭記〉、蘇轍〈黃州快哉亭記〉，則下列敘述，正確的選項是：", "options": {"A": "玄德訪孔明兩次不遇，欲再往訪之。關公曰：「兄長兩次親往拜謁，其禮\n太過矣。想諸葛亮有虛名而無實學，故避而不敢見。兄何惑於斯人之甚也？」", "B": "巨靈神回至營門，徑見托塔天王，忙哈哈跪下道：「弼馬溫果是神通廣大！\n末將戰他不得，敗陣回來請罪。」李天王發怒道：「這廝剉吾銳氣，推出\n斬之！」", "C": "孔明曰：「亮夜觀天象，劉表不久人世；劉璋非立業之主，久後必歸將軍。」\n玄德聞言，頓首拜謝。只這一席話，乃孔明未出茅廬，已知三分天下。真\n萬古之人不及也", "D": "當時林沖扳將過來，卻認得是本管高衙內，先自手軟了。高衙內說道：「林\n沖，干你甚事！你來多管！」原來高衙內不認得他是林沖的娘子，若還認\n得時，也沒這場事", "E": "八戒道：「哥哥說得有理。你去，你去。若是打敗了這老妖，還趕將這裡\n來，等老豬截住殺他。」好行者，一隻手提著鐵棒，一隻手拖著死虎，徑\n至他洞口。正是：法師有難逢妖怪，情性相和伏亂魔"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "DE", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 27.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 80.0, "E": 89.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 10.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 66.0, "D": 92.0, "E": 98.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 47.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 65.0, "E": 75.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 55.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [59.0, 47.0, 37.0, 27.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-chinese-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chinese", "subject_zh": "國文", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "閱讀下列現代詩〈我不和你談論〉，選出敘述正確的選項：\n我不和你談論詩藝／不和你談論那些糾纏不清的隱喻／請離開書房／我\n帶你去廣袤的田野走走／去看看遍處的幼苗／如何沉默地奮力生長\n我不和你談論人生／不和你談論那些深奧玄妙的思潮／請離開書房／我\n帶你去廣袤的田野走走／去撫觸清涼的河水／如何沉默地灌溉田地\n我不和你談論社會／不和你談論那些痛徹心肺的爭奪／請離開書房／我\n帶你去廣袤的田野走走／去探望一群一群的農人／如何沉默地揮汗耕作\n你久居鬧熱滾滾的都城／詩藝呀！人生呀！社會呀／已爭辯了很多／這\n是急於播種的春日／而你難得來鄉間／我帶你去廣袤的田野走走／去領略領\n略春風／如何溫柔地吹拂著大地", "options": {"A": "詩的第三段，末句的「沉默」與前兩句的「談論」相對照，暗示與其爭辯\n不休，不如默默耕耘", "B": "作者不和「你」談詩藝、人生、社會，「你」代表腳踏實地而常來鄉間的\n都市知識份子", "C": "作者認為，到「廣袤的田野」比在「書房」更能真切體會生活的內涵與生\n命的意義", "D": "詩中藉奮力生長的幼苗、灌溉田地的河水、揮汗耕作的農人等，展現田野\n的生命力", "E": "這首詩間接呈現作者喜歡玄思妙想的性格，以及追求華麗辭藻、艱深隱喻\n的寫作態度\n- 6 -\n第 7 頁 96年學測\n共 7 頁 國文考科\n第 二 部 分 ： 非 選 擇 題 （ 共 三 大 題 ， 佔 54 分 ）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "ACD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 84.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 85.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 91.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 100.0, "D": 93.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 74.0, "E": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 85.0, 79.0, 68.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
